    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to Sector 7. You are a rogue decker known only as 'Cipher', hired by an anonymous syndicate to breach the Megacorp's central data vault. You've jacked your consciousness directly into their highly restricted subnet, and the Black ICE here is thick. The system is a treacherous labyrinth of obsolete corporate tech patched together with cutting-edge experimental firewalls. If you stay too long, the system's neural-feedback loops will fry your brain. Your ultimate goal is to navigate this digital maze, bypass the Final Verification Node, and extract the encrypted payload before the corporate AI traces your bio-signal. Pay close attention to the flow of data between the various terminals and processors scattered throughout the neon-lit architecture. Every node serves a purpose, and routing the right data to the right machine is the only way to survive.",
